    "profile": {
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "HTML",
          "html": "Success came early for Ghulam Abbas. He was a student when he toured Celyon in 1964, and subsequent trips to Australia in 1964-65 and England in 1967 followed. But he played only one Test, at The Oval in 1967, when he scored 0 and 12.  A left-hand batsman, he was strong off the back foot."
        }
      ]
